WEBVTT

00:24.266 --> 00:32.090
Kelsey's office. Three o'clock. She said to

00:32.211 --> 00:33.651
come alone.

00:36.173 --> 00:40.255
The door's shut. The air is thick.

00:44.128 --> 00:46.450
uniform.

00:47.611 --> 00:52.094
My blood runs cold, my hands go numb. I can't feel

00:52.114 --> 00:57.157
my own chair. He's holding out a folded sheet.

00:57.938 --> 01:04.202
This isn't fair. He looks at me. His face is grim.

01:06.324 --> 01:09.666
He starts to read the line. He doesn't know the

01:09.726 --> 01:12.628
words he holds are a trigger to my mind.

01:16.796 --> 01:18.580
Saratoga to the mind!

01:27.419 --> 01:31.280
Are you Aubrey Jordan Fuller? Stop the press!

01:31.660 --> 01:38.742
That is not my name! Stop the press! She's won the

01:38.782 --> 01:46.964
game! He's here! She's won! The walls are gone!

01:47.044 --> 01:50.465
No! No! No! No! No!

01:57.755 --> 02:08.763
No! No! No! No! No! No!

02:08.984 --> 02:12.846
Can't breathe. Can't see. Rocking. Shaking!

02:13.107 --> 02:17.970
King! King! Shaking! The lights are bright! The

02:18.010 --> 02:22.774
world is breaking! King! King! King! King! He's

02:22.834 --> 02:33.057
just a man. A uniform. He's just her. He's her in

02:33.077 --> 02:33.318
here.

02:51.318 --> 02:55.259
Are you Aubrey Jordan Fuller? SYSTEM CRASHED!

02:55.659 --> 03:02.420
THAT IS NOT MY NAME! SYSTEM CRASHED! SHE'S WON

03:02.440 --> 03:10.182
THE GAME! HE'S HERE! SHE'S WON! THE WALLS ARE

03:10.282 --> 03:14.522
GONE! NO! NO! NO! NO!

03:23.238 --> 03:31.241
No! No! No! No! No! No! Gone. Not me. Not me.

